// FAULTLINE_ALLHOODS_ALLEYSHOOT_POLICESHOOTER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P2379640471" "You'll never get away with this!  Put the gun down and step away from the building!"
// FAULTLINE_ALLHOODS_ALLEYSHOOT_POLICESHOOTER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P2558349723" "Are you crazy?  I'm a policeman!  Do you know how much time in the Zig you'll get for this??"
// FAULTLINE_ALLHOODS_ALLEYSHOOT_POLICESHOOTER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1217435474" "You can't win!  Just put the gun down!"

// FAULTLINE_ALLHOODS_ALLEYSHOOT_POLICESHOOTER_ALERT_TEXT :
"P3958771294" "Get over here and help!"
// FAULTLINE_ALLHOODS_ALLEYSHOOT_POLICESHOOTER_ALERT_TEXT :
"P1118723918" "You!  Over here!  Now!"
// FAULTLINE_ALLHOODS_ALLEYSHOOT_POLICESHOOTER_ALERT_TEXT :
"P2088917093" "Don't just stand there, get to work, hero!"

// FAULTLINE_NEWOVERBROOK_ARRESTWALL_LOSTSUSPECT_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P382379719" "So many changes.  You don't realize what's coming.  This is so unimportant in the grand scheme of things."
// FAULTLINE_NEWOVERBROOK_ARRESTWALL_LOSTSUSPECT_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P731053935" "Arresting me does nothing.  What is coming is bigger than you, me, all of us."
// FAULTLINE_NEWOVERBROOK_ARRESTWALL_LOSTSUSPECT_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P2383515338" "You waste your time, cop.  This is so insignificant compared to what is coming.  Can't you see the changes already?"
// FAULTLINE_NEWOVERBROOK_ARRESTWALL_LOSTSUSPECT_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P2690398375" "Incarceration is temporary.  What is coming is so much bigger.  The flood, it's just the beginning."

// FAULTLINE_NEWOVERBROOK_ARRESTWALL_LOSTSUSPECT_ALERT_TEXT :
"P1866438087" "Ah interruptions!  Useful!"
// FAULTLINE_NEWOVERBROOK_ARRESTWALL_LOSTSUSPECT_ALERT_TEXT :
"P3827390273" "Now, we fight, cop!"
// FAULTLINE_NEWOVERBROOK_ARRESTWALL_LOSTSUSPECT_ALERT_TEXT :
"P1542895777" "I told you this was not over!"
// FAULTLINE_NEWOVERBROOK_ARRESTWALL_LOSTSUSPECT_ALERT_TEXT :
"P2797223247" "New Overbrook just became less safe."
// FAULTLINE_NEWOVERBROOK_ARRESTWALL_LOSTSUSPECT_ALERT_TEXT :
"P2292450192" "Yes, help the cop, hero!  He needs it!"

// FAULTLINE_NEWOVERBROOK_ARRESTWALL_ARMEDOFFICER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P3962147918" "Quiet.  You have the right to remain silent..."
// FAULTLINE_NEWOVERBROOK_ARRESTWALL_ARMEDOFFICER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P270729561" "Don't move.  You've been terrorizing the folks of New Overbrook long enough."
// FAULTLINE_NEWOVERBROOK_ARRESTWALL_ARMEDOFFICER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P390903309" "Your reign of terror ends now.  Do not move."
// FAULTLINE_NEWOVERBROOK_ARRESTWALL_ARMEDOFFICER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P2284212263" "Kidnapping, assault, battery: the list goes on.  You're going to be in prison for quite some time."
// FAULTLINE_NEWOVERBROOK_ARRESTWALL_ARMEDOFFICER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P2274080520" "Sir, I advise you to remain silent.  You're in deep trouble as it is."

// FAULTLINE_NEWOVERBROOK_ARRESTWALL_POLICE_WALKIETALKIE_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P514452538" "Yeah, we got one.  There's more.  I've been hearing of kidnappings all over Overbrook."
// FAULTLINE_NEWOVERBROOK_ARRESTWALL_POLICE_WALKIETALKIE_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P2300506556" "Yes, sir.  We'll bring him in shortly."
// FAULTLINE_NEWOVERBROOK_ARRESTWALL_POLICE_WALKIETALKIE_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1563242444" "Yes, sir.  When can I expect transport?"
// FAULTLINE_NEWOVERBROOK_ARRESTWALL_POLICE_WALKIETALKIE_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P3654655126" "Yes, sir.  He was caught trying to abduct one of the construction workers."

// FAULTLINE_ALLHOODS_ARRESTWALL_SUSPECT_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P2361451512" "You know I'm just going to get away."
// FAULTLINE_ALLHOODS_ARRESTWALL_SUSPECT_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P586047864" "This again.  You know there's going to be an interruption and I'm going to get away.  Why do you bother?"
// FAULTLINE_ALLHOODS_ARRESTWALL_SUSPECT_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P613114864" "Oh, here we go again.  Read my rights again, I so love to hear them."
// FAULTLINE_ALLHOODS_ARRESTWALL_SUSPECT_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P3532146535" "I'm sorry, I'm facing the wall.  I can't hear you.  Speak up, will you?  You're mumbling."
// FAULTLINE_ALLHOODS_ARRESTWALL_SUSPECT_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P735059715" "This is so pointless.  You'll never get me to the Zig and you know it."

// FAULTLINE_ALLHOODS_ARRESTWALL_SUSPECT_ALERT_TEXT :
"P3397360012" "See?  What did I tell you?"
// FAULTLINE_ALLHOODS_ARRESTWALL_SUSPECT_ALERT_TEXT :
"P2802131445" "Ha!  Free again!"
// FAULTLINE_ALLHOODS_ARRESTWALL_SUSPECT_ALERT_TEXT :
"P2020872103" "I told you!"
// FAULTLINE_ALLHOODS_ARRESTWALL_SUSPECT_ALERT_TEXT :
"P235669607" "Didn't I tell you??"

// FAULTLINE_ALLHOODS_ARRESTWALL_ARMEDOFFICER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1585718022" "Sir, I need you to remain quiet."
// FAULTLINE_ALLHOODS_ARRESTWALL_ARMEDOFFICER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P942165082" "Sir, I must insist that you remain quiet.  I've read you your rights.  Anything you do or say can be used against you in a court of law."
// FAULTLINE_ALLHOODS_ARRESTWALL_ARMEDOFFICER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P157343286" "You have the right to remain silent.  If you give up that right..."

// FAULTLINE_ARRESTWALL_POLICE_WALKIETALKIE_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P991197425" "As usual, he's arguing the arrest, but no physical resistance...yet."
// FAULTLINE_ARRESTWALL_POLICE_WALKIETALKIE_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P3543531491" "He's getting pretty aggressive.  We may need back-up."
// FAULTLINE_ARRESTWALL_POLICE_WALKIETALKIE_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P3602621366" "We're good here, sir.  Nothing we can't handle."
// FAULTLINE_ARRESTWALL_POLICE_WALKIETALKIE_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P2639399670" "Yes, sir.  As soon as we finish interrogating we'll bring him in for processing."

// FAULTLINE_ALLHOODS_CAUGHT_INTERROGATOR_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P270263172" "Don't move.  You'll only make things harder for yourself."
// FAULTLINE_ALLHOODS_CAUGHT_INTERROGATOR_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P3699555269" "Do you really want to add resisting arrest to your list of crimes?"
// FAULTLINE_ALLHOODS_CAUGHT_INTERROGATOR_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P4146373894" "I advise you to stop talking."
// FAULTLINE_ALLHOODS_CAUGHT_INTERROGATOR_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P3685287213" "You're making this harder on yourself.  You need to remain silent."

// FAULTLINE_ALLHOODS_CAUGHT_INTERROGATOR_ALERT_TEXT :
"P2098303096" "Stop!"
// FAULTLINE_ALLHOODS_CAUGHT_INTERROGATOR_ALERT_TEXT :
"P2483371869" "You!  Get over here and help!"
// FAULTLINE_ALLHOODS_CAUGHT_INTERROGATOR_ALERT_TEXT :
"P2441842938" "Resisting arrest!"
// FAULTLINE_ALLHOODS_CAUGHT_INTERROGATOR_ALERT_TEXT :
"P1887442813" "He's getting away!  Help out, hero!"
// FAULTLINE_ALLHOODS_CAUGHT_INTERROGATOR_ALERT_TEXT :
"P1174692279" "Hero!  Get over here and help!"

// FAULTLINE_ALLHOODS_CAUGHT_LOSTVICTIM_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P3449619154" "This is temporary."
// FAULTLINE_ALLHOODS_CAUGHT_LOSTVICTIM_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1350721676" "I'll be away in no time."
// FAULTLINE_ALLHOODS_CAUGHT_LOSTVICTIM_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P3901324847" "You're not going to be able to hold me.  You KNOW that."
// FAULTLINE_ALLHOODS_CAUGHT_LOSTVICTIM_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P2129749587" "Must we do this again?  You know I'll get away."
// FAULTLINE_ALLHOODS_CAUGHT_LOSTVICTIM_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1896248604" "You police, so naive."
// FAULTLINE_ALLHOODS_CAUGHT_LOSTVICTIM_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1458882864" "You don't even get that I could snap your neck like a twig if I wanted to."

// FAULTLINE_ALLHOODS_CAUGHT_LOSTVICTIM_ALERT_TEXT :
"P2630850317" "Now it is MY turn!"
// FAULTLINE_ALLHOODS_CAUGHT_LOSTVICTIM_ALERT_TEXT :
"P259031165" "And now we come to it."
// FAULTLINE_ALLHOODS_CAUGHT_LOSTVICTIM_ALERT_TEXT :
"P1160314656" "And this is where the tide turns to my favor."
// FAULTLINE_ALLHOODS_CAUGHT_LOSTVICTIM_ALERT_TEXT :
"P3391779111" "You have no chance now!"

// FAULTLINE_ALLHOODS_CAUGHT_VAHZILOKVICTIM_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P843351074" "Is this really necessary?  It was just a light dinner."
// FAULTLINE_ALLHOODS_CAUGHT_VAHZILOKVICTIM_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P678483089" "It was a body.  He wasn't using it anymore."
// FAULTLINE_ALLHOODS_CAUGHT_VAHZILOKVICTIM_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P516569650" "Two bodies.  You're arresting me for 'borrowing' two bodies?"

// FAULTLINE_ALLHOODS_CAUGHT_VAHZILOKVICTIM_ALERT_TEXT :
"P2472347215" "Ha!  Let the games begin!"
// FAULTLINE_ALLHOODS_CAUGHT_VAHZILOKVICTIM_ALERT_TEXT :
"P2809763211" "And now it gets interesting!"
// FAULTLINE_ALLHOODS_CAUGHT_VAHZILOKVICTIM_ALERT_TEXT :
"P3624875301" "Oh look.  A distraction.  How convenient!"

// FAULTLINE_ALLHOODS_COFFEEBREAK_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P259017154" "This is the best place ever."
// FAULTLINE_ALLHOODS_COFFEEBREAK_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P3958663152" "Does it get any better?  Does it?"
// FAULTLINE_ALLHOODS_COFFEEBREAK_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1821275028" "What did you get?  Kona blend or French Roast?"
// FAULTLINE_ALLHOODS_COFFEEBREAK_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P3976778042" "Five more minutes, then we'll head out on patrol."
// FAULTLINE_ALLHOODS_COFFEEBREAK_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1115228381" "I got the sprinkles today.  Tomorrow, I think I'll go for glazed."

// FAULTLINE_ALLHOODS_COFFEEBREAK_ALERT_TEXT :
"P318777893" "You there!  Hold it!"


// FAULTLINE_ALLHOODS_FLASHLIGHTSEARCH_WALKIETALKIE_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P2675444475" "Nah, we're clear here.  This is locked up tight."
// FAULTLINE_ALLHOODS_FLASHLIGHTSEARCH_WALKIETALKIE_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1627258828" "Looks good here.  We'll move on to the next location."
// FAULTLINE_ALLHOODS_FLASHLIGHTSEARCH_WALKIETALKIE_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P856352606" "Nope.  It's clean.  We're moving on."
// FAULTLINE_ALLHOODS_FLASHLIGHTSEARCH_WALKIETALKIE_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P3506591343" "What was the complaint again?"

// FAULTLINE_ALLHOODS_FLASHLIGHTSEARCH_FLASHLIGHTHOLDER_ALERT_TEXT :
"P398869057" "I found something!"
// FAULTLINE_ALLHOODS_FLASHLIGHTSEARCH_FLASHLIGHTHOLDER_ALERT_TEXT :
"P2904038148" "We're not alone!"
// FAULTLINE_ALLHOODS_FLASHLIGHTSEARCH_FLASHLIGHTHOLDER_ALERT_TEXT :
"P3901762013" "Cover me!"

// FAULTLINE_ALLHOODS_PATROL_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P4040795918" "Stick to the streets for a while and then we'll continue on to the warehouses."
// FAULTLINE_ALLHOODS_PATROL_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P789879856" "Keep an eye out.  You never know what you're going to run into these days."
// FAULTLINE_ALLHOODS_PATROL_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P628933200" "Stick together, squad.  This area can get tricky."
// FAULTLINE_ALLHOODS_PATROL_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P586748824" "Follow me.  We'll do the circuit four times and then head back to interior patrols."

// FAULTLINE_ALLHOODS_PATROL_ALERT_TEXT :
"P249993822" "Stick together!"
// FAULTLINE_ALLHOODS_PATROL_ALERT_TEXT :
"P2189132823" "There!  Freeze!!"
// FAULTLINE_ALLHOODS_PATROL_ALERT_TEXT :
"P1925365149" "Stop right there!"
// FAULTLINE_ALLHOODS_PATROL_ALERT_TEXT :
"P275428776" "Draw your weapons, squad!"
// FAULTLINE_ALLHOODS_PATROL_ALERT_TEXT :
"P2447497054" "Watch each other's backs!"

// FAULTLINE_ALLHOODS_WALLLEAN_ALERT_TEXT :
"P593665464" "Well, your day just got worse, criminal."
// FAULTLINE_ALLHOODS_WALLLEAN_ALERT_TEXT :
"P2256087776" "Justice never takes a break.  How unlucky for you."
// FAULTLINE_ALLHOODS_WALLLEAN_ALERT_TEXT :
"P4272505746" "Ah, just the criminal I was waiting for."
// FAULTLINE_ALLHOODS_WALLLEAN_ALERT_TEXT :
"P1669513616" "Going somewhere?"
// FAULTLINE_ALLHOODS_WALLLEAN_ALERT_TEXT :
"P1761873526" "Did you think you would elude me forever?  I have a good memory."

// FAULTLINE_NEWOVERBROOK_CARSHOOT_POLICE_ALERT_TEXT :
"P1244276805" "You'll never get away with this!"
// FAULTLINE_NEWOVERBROOK_CARSHOOT_POLICE_ALERT_TEXT :
"P2071167404" "You're gonna go away for a very long time!"
// FAULTLINE_NEWOVERBROOK_CARSHOOT_POLICE_ALERT_TEXT :
"P3918990776" "Hero's here!  Give us a hand!"

// FAULTLINE_NEWOVERBROOK_ROADRUMBLE_WALKIETALKIE_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1072781243" "We need help here!  This is getting nasty!"
// FAULTLINE_NEWOVERBROOK_ROADRUMBLE_WALKIETALKIE_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P3021634715" "Send some units over...NOW!"
// FAULTLINE_NEWOVERBROOK_ROADRUMBLE_WALKIETALKIE_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1124549853" "It's getting pretty nasty.  If I spot any heroes, I'll grab them for help."

// FAULTLINE_NEWOVERBROOK_ROADRUMBLE_WALKIETALKIE_ALERT_TEXT :
"P3446221885" "Don't just stand there, hero!  Get in here and help!"
// FAULTLINE_NEWOVERBROOK_ROADRUMBLE_WALKIETALKIE_ALERT_TEXT :
"P3371782397" "Hero!  Get over here!"
// FAULTLINE_NEWOVERBROOK_ROADRUMBLE_WALKIETALKIE_ALERT_TEXT :
"P2121824797" "Get over here and give us a hand, hero!"

// FAULTLINE_NEWOVERBROOK_CARARREST_POLICE_WRITINGTICKET_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P111570830" "I can't believe you fit in that car, let alone managed to speed on these city streets."
// FAULTLINE_NEWOVERBROOK_CARARREST_POLICE_WRITINGTICKET_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P2822345176" "Unbelievable.  You're kidding me, right?"
// FAULTLINE_NEWOVERBROOK_CARARREST_POLICE_WRITINGTICKET_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P4096049482" "It's too bad I can't arrest you for stupidity."
// FAULTLINE_NEWOVERBROOK_CARARREST_POLICE_WRITINGTICKET_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P3095611835" "I...I don't know where to begin...so many offences..."
// FAULTLINE_NEWOVERBROOK_CARARREST_POLICE_WRITINGTICKET_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P2030243380" "You realize that's a small car, right?  How did you even FIT in there?"

// FAULTLINE_NEWOVERBROOK_CARARREST_POLICE_WRITINGTICKET_ALERT_TEXT :
"P1744041428" "Freeze!  Hero, get over here!"
// FAULTLINE_NEWOVERBROOK_CARARREST_POLICE_WRITINGTICKET_ALERT_TEXT :
"P4054062183" "Hold it right there!"
// FAULTLINE_NEWOVERBROOK_CARARREST_POLICE_WRITINGTICKET_ALERT_TEXT :
"P2715355462" "Freeze!  Or I'll shoot!"

// FAULTLINE_NEWOVERBROOK_CARARREST_LOSTSUSPECT_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P2798862120" "I don't know what you're talking about.  We were doing the posted speed limit."
// FAULTLINE_NEWOVERBROOK_CARARREST_LOSTSUSPECT_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1533460769" "Well, maybe one of us wasn't wearing a seatbelt and maybe he was.  I'm not saying anything until a lawyer arrives."
// FAULTLINE_NEWOVERBROOK_CARARREST_LOSTSUSPECT_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P3498606193" "On the grand scheme of things, cop, you're really wasting your time."
// FAULTLINE_NEWOVERBROOK_CARARREST_LOSTSUSPECT_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P4076716928" "Maybe I ran the red and maybe I didn't.  I wouldn't be the first."
// FAULTLINE_NEWOVERBROOK_CARARREST_LOSTSUSPECT_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P689913215" "This is police harassment.  EVERYONE runs those lights."

// FAULTLINE_NEWOVERBROOK_CARARREST_LOSTSUSPECT_ALERT_TEXT :
"P1813358343" "I love distractions!"
// FAULTLINE_NEWOVERBROOK_CARARREST_LOSTSUSPECT_ALERT_TEXT :
"P2078719134" "Hey, hero!  Thanks for the diversion!"
// FAULTLINE_NEWOVERBROOK_CARARREST_LOSTSUSPECT_ALERT_TEXT :
"P4185378648" "Sucker!"
// FAULTLINE_NEWOVERBROOK_CARARREST_LOSTSUSPECT_ALERT_TEXT :
"P2514249158" "I've got your number, cop!  Count on it!"

// FAULTLINE_ALLHOODS_COPCHAT_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P894166591" "Well, sure I wish we had a full-on police station like the other cities, but they're in the middle of reconstruction.  I can't exactly get all bent out of shape about it.  At least we have that portable over there."
// FAULTLINE_ALLHOODS_COPCHAT_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P932226362" "Hey, want to head over to the Drenched Donut later?"
// FAULTLINE_ALLHOODS_COPCHAT_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P818451774" "Just some odd things I've noticed.  Circle of Thorns are gone.  All those other villains have moved in.  They're not ten feet from this station.  Now that takes nerves of steel."
// FAULTLINE_ALLHOODS_COPCHAT_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P2055359792" "I don't know if they'll ever get the construction finished, to be honest.  All these interruptions.  There's only so many of us.  Even with hero help, they just keep coming."
// FAULTLINE_ALLHOODS_COPCHAT_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P2733040007" "I've been to the Rusty Rivet a few times.  Nice pub.  Not as good as O'Flaherty's, but it's not bad."
// FAULTLINE_ALLHOODS_COPCHAT_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P2719445808" "I'm not kidding you.  Like, FIVE gigantic Lost crammed into a mini.  Most hysterical thing I've ever seen."
// FAULTLINE_ALLHOODS_COPCHAT_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P2293182888" "It was the weirdest thing.  They guard that girl at Yin's Market like she's one of them and they don't even attack us.  Everything else, sure, but not us or the heroes.  Strange."

// FAULTLINE_ALLHOODS_COPCHAT_ALERT_TEXT :
"P1900288757" "Time to earn our pay!"
// FAULTLINE_ALLHOODS_COPCHAT_ALERT_TEXT :
"P2610094906" "Time to clean up the streets!"
// FAULTLINE_ALLHOODS_COPCHAT_ALERT_TEXT :
"P3569583464" "Over there!"
// FAULTLINE_ALLHOODS_COPCHAT_ALERT_TEXT :
"P832520016" "Careful!"

// FAULTLINE_ALLHOODS_WEAPONCHECK_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P313279207" "Spot checks all this week.  Safety first, people."
// FAULTLINE_ALLHOODS_WEAPONCHECK_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P3755231377" "I got some heat from the Captain last week.  I know this is a mobile unit, but it's no excuse for sloppy maintenance."
// FAULTLINE_ALLHOODS_WEAPONCHECK_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P2493844767" "Our scores this last week were deplorable.  I will keep holding weapon spot checks until I get some positive feedback from the higher ups."
// FAULTLINE_ALLHOODS_WEAPONCHECK_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P3748810346" "Safety and cleanliness, men.  Safety and cleanliness."

// FAULTLINE_ALLHOODS_WEAPONCHECK_ALERT_TEXT :
"P769091037" "Time to go to work, men!"
// FAULTLINE_ALLHOODS_WEAPONCHECK_ALERT_TEXT :
