// FAULTLINE_ALLHOODS_WEAPONCHECK_ALERT_TEXT :
"P3120432230" "Let's go!"
// FAULTLINE_ALLHOODS_WEAPONCHECK_ALERT_TEXT :
"P1916660419" "Watch out!"

// FAULTLINE_NEWOVERBROOK_BORDERCHECK_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P423079368" "Sir, I'm well aware that you travel back and forth several times a day between here and Skyway City.  However, it is my job to ensure that all vehicles coming into this area are accounted for.  I do ask for your patience."
// FAULTLINE_NEWOVERBROOK_BORDERCHECK_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1365122140" "Yes, I appreciate that this is an inconvenience, however, you WILL notice that you entered this area through an underpass and not a SWAT door."
// FAULTLINE_NEWOVERBROOK_BORDERCHECK_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1310041086" "License and registration, please."
// FAULTLINE_NEWOVERBROOK_BORDERCHECK_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P4059969537" "Yes, sir.  I'm checking every vehicle that comes into this area.  Yes, I have probably checked your ID twice today.  Yes, sir.  I do understand it's a 'hassle'.  Yes, I will be checking it again the NEXT time you come in."

// FAULTLINE_NEWOVERBROOK_BORDERCHECK_ALERT_TEXT :
"P3496974583" "Take cover!"
// FAULTLINE_NEWOVERBROOK_BORDERCHECK_ALERT_TEXT :
"P3662585452" "Sir!  Take cover!"
// FAULTLINE_NEWOVERBROOK_BORDERCHECK_ALERT_TEXT :
"P739788321" "Forget the vehicle!  Run!"
// FAULTLINE_NEWOVERBROOK_BORDERCHECK_ALERT_TEXT :
"P3779461010" "For your safety, head to the nearest building and run inside!"

// RWZ_VANGUARDBASE_FLASHLIGHTUP_WALKIETALKIE_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P2583107835" "Base, this is Jones.  Yeah, we're just making our rounds now.  I'll report back in a bit."
// RWZ_VANGUARDBASE_FLASHLIGHTUP_WALKIETALKIE_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P2806879364" "I'm looking at it now.  Over."
// RWZ_VANGUARDBASE_FLASHLIGHTUP_WALKIETALKIE_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P917367340" "I'm at that location now, sir.  Over."

// RWZ_CRASHSITE_LOITER_TALKER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1855184536" "I don't know WHEN this happened.  What on EARTH are those gigantic thing sprouting up around the ship? That's what I want to know."
// RWZ_CRASHSITE_LOITER_TALKER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P3864330300" "I don't know.  We keep our noses out of it.  Let Longbow and Vanguard sort it out.  We're just support."
// RWZ_CRASHSITE_LOITER_TALKER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1481613389" "You know, half the time I don't even know who I can and cannot draw my weapon on."
// RWZ_CRASHSITE_LOITER_TALKER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P3860354283" "You notice how with everyone focused on the Rikti, groups like Malta and Nemesis have made their way in.  Figures."
// RWZ_CRASHSITE_LOITER_TALKER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P3272451950" "I'm just saying we need to keep an eye out.  Rikti is one threat we recognize.  Who knows if any of these villains will suddenly go rogue on us?  I don't think a leopard can change its spots."

// RWZ_CRASHSITE_LOITER_TALKER_ALERT_TEXT :
"P773693633" "Whoa!  Where'd that come from!"
// RWZ_CRASHSITE_LOITER_TALKER_ALERT_TEXT :
"P2613717307" "Guys!  Help me out here!"

// RWZ_CRASHSITE_LOITER_WALKIETALKIE_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P3556234957" "Man, it is brutal over there.  We got reinforcements coming?"
// RWZ_CRASHSITE_LOITER_WALKIETALKIE_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1626970934" "We can't get near those pylons without taking major hits.  We'll need reinforcements."
// RWZ_CRASHSITE_LOITER_WALKIETALKIE_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P2916905424" "One of those UXB things practically took the leg off one of my officers last week.  You guys keep your eyes open for them.  It's not like you can miss it."
// RWZ_CRASHSITE_LOITER_WALKIETALKIE_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1144974124" "Yeah, got it.  Thanks for the update.  You sending more Vanguard over?  Okay."

// RWZ_CRASHSITE_LOITER_WALKIETALKIE_ALERT_TEXT :
"P3833113806" "Back to work!"
// RWZ_CRASHSITE_LOITER_WALKIETALKIE_ALERT_TEXT :
"P328549154" "We're back on the clock!"

// RWZ_CRASHSITE_ROBOTPATROL_ALERT_TEXT :
