// FB_SEEID_CRASHER_FASHIONSHOW_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P3530838567" "Hey, man, this is police brutality!  I'm with the...uh...lighting crew!"
// FB_SEEID_CRASHER_FASHIONSHOW_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P3525909737" "I know my rights!  I'm with the band!  I just don't have any ID!  None of us do!  That's why we're in a band!"
// FB_SEEID_CRASHER_FASHIONSHOW_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1880963728" "Hey, take it easy!  I was just watching..."
// FB_SEEID_CRASHER_FASHIONSHOW_INACTIVE_TEXT :
