"P3817368419" "Hero!  Give us a hand!"
// HOLLOWS_ALLHOODS_BATTLE_PPDTROLLS_PPD_ALERT_TEXT :
"P1442895793" "Step in, Hero!"

// HOLLOWS_ALLHOODS_COPCHAT_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1860706763" "I dunno.  This isn't a bad detail, I suppose.  Faultline has that donut shop, though.  You can't get a decent donut here."
// HOLLOWS_ALLHOODS_COPCHAT_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1417894773" "Well, it's insulting, really.  We don't just stand around eating donuts all day.  Do we ask Hellions if they just go around burning stuff all day?  No."
// HOLLOWS_ALLHOODS_COPCHAT_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P2053935420" "Word on the street is that the Legacy Chain has more going on than they're telling us.  Really hush hush.  Any ideas?"
// HOLLOWS_ALLHOODS_COPCHAT_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P2587906889" "My buddy got called over to Grendel's Gulch the other day to stop a disturbance.  If I ever get called over there, I'm quitting.  I'm just telling you now."
// HOLLOWS_ALLHOODS_COPCHAT_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P3940204279" "All I'm saying is that we have a disadvantage.  I can't fly, can you?"
// HOLLOWS_ALLHOODS_COPCHAT_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P3718665129" "Did you see the old units they had here?  Talk about an embarrassment!  You can't even drive those pieces of junk!"

// HOLLOWS_ALLHOODS_COPCHAT_ALERT_TEXT :
"P1132811078" "Police!"

// HOLLOWS_ALLHOODS_CHECKPOINT_WALKIETALKIE_INACTIVE_TEXT :
