// HOLLOWS_ALLHOODS_CARARREST_SUSPECT_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P3229226072" "I didn't steal her purse.  Honest.  That was my sister's purse and she tried to take it from ME!"
// HOLLOWS_ALLHOODS_CARARREST_SUSPECT_INACTIVE_TEXT :
