// BRICKSTOWN_CITIZEN_CHAT_PPD_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P3991169585" "I pray the PPD can clean up this town for good."
// BRICKSTOWN_CITIZEN_CHAT_PPD_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P3996650845" "I was driving on the bridge the other day and a gang of Freakshow came outta nowhere. They nearly flipped my car over!"
// BRICKSTOWN_CITIZEN_CHAT_PPD_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P3781708176" "This town's gonna be the next Kings Row, I know it."
// BRICKSTOWN_CITIZEN_CHAT_PPD_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P9678053" "Sure, Sinclair spent a lot of money cleaning up Brickstown's parks but what about the streets?"
// BRICKSTOWN_CITIZEN_CHAT_PPD_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P4105390255" "The homeless I can tolerate, but these Freakshow guys are the worst!"
// BRICKSTOWN_CITIZEN_CHAT_PPD_INACTIVE_TEXT :
