// BRICKSTOWN_CITIZEN_CHAT_PPD_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P3048141990" "I feel much safer with you guys around."

// BRICKSTOWN_PPD_CHAT_CITIZEN_INACTIVE_TEXT :
